'''Frozen Orbs''' are objects that appear during the fight with [[Akkha]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], where they appear if he unleashes his Trailing Orbs attack, and the player moves whilst in the south-west quadrant. It will damage and temporarily slow players' attack speed by 1 tick if they walk into one.

